Subject: [PATCH 3/9] fix(access): revoke the previous role's default grants on
 demotion

updateMember seeded the new role's defaults on a role change but never
withdrew the old role's, so a demoted human kept them. users:manage_permissions
among them, which is a self-escalation path: the demoted member can re-grant
themselves the permissions the demotion just removed.

